SOFTWARE LICENSE
================

The extraction logic of this project is ported from the upstream project
`RLPE-Radiolarian-Plate-Extractor`:

    https://github.com/syxscott/RLPE-Radiolarian-Plate-Extractor

This project inherits that project's license terms. The authoritative text
lives with the upstream repository, linked above; this file states the terms
in force here so that a reader does not have to guess:

  * The software is provided for RESEARCH AND EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY.
  * The upstream terms apply in full. Where this summary and the upstream
    text differ, the upstream text governs.
  * No warranty is given, to the extent permitted by law: the software is
    provided "as is", and the authors accept no liability for any use made
    of it, including in published work.

Attribution is requested. If you use this tool in published work, please
cite it as set out in CITATION.cff, and say which release you used.

DATA LICENSE
============

The DATA this tool EXTRACTS AND EXPORTS is released under
CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

This covers the occurrence records, the range charts, the occurrence
matrices and the other tabular outputs -- the files you publish alongside a
paper. It does not cover the figures the data were read from: those remain
the property of their publishers, and it is the user's responsibility to
have the right to publish what is derived from them.

The "CC0" declaration above is what rca_core/standards/darwin_core.py
writes into the `<distribution><license>` element of every Darwin Core
Archive this tool produces, so the exported archive states the same terms
this file does.

WHAT IS NOT LICENSED
====================

Nothing in this repository grants any right over the sample figures under
`_figtest/`, the reference payloads under `tests/fixtures/real_payloads/`,
or any figure from the published literature. Those are research inputs
with their own provenance, kept for reproducibility of the project's own
evaluation.
